### ============================================================
### BFF: Sitemaps — the detail-page sitemaps (#367)
###
### Read-only, no auth. A crawler reads these at the site root,
### /sitemap-<kind>.xml, through the frontend's injector sidecar.
### ============================================================

### Events that are not over yet, in both locales
GET {{bff-host}}/api/sitemaps/events.xml
Accept: application/xml

### Every venue
GET {{bff-host}}/api/sitemaps/venues.xml
Accept: application/xml

### Artists with an event that is not over yet
GET {{bff-host}}/api/sitemaps/artists.xml
Accept: application/xml

### Promoters with an event that is not over yet
GET {{bff-host}}/api/sitemaps/promoters.xml
Accept: application/xml
